+
+I inspected an empty workspace before importing my prior project. I recorded a failed initial Git status command because the directory was not yet a repository; I do not count it as task-run friction.
+
+I initially tried to install pytest, Ruff and PyYAML within the default sandbox. I observed DNS resolution failures for pypi.org. I retried with approved network access and installed the exact versions successfully. I installed pinned build tools separately before verifying the documented editable installation.
+
+I observed that `.agents/` is write protected by this environment. I kept my inherited review skill in `skills/reviewing_pull_requests/`, preserved its original bytes and documented that location. I did not silently install or activate a third-party skill collection.
